q...\nFull Package (projects, quizzes, structure, certificate)  https://www.datawithbaraa.com/course/...\nSubscribe for more Free Data content:    / @datawithbaraa  \n\n🏆 DATA ACADEMY\nSQL https://www.datawithbaraa.com/course/...\nPython https://www.datawithbaraa.com/course/...\nPython Handbook (sketches, notes, code) https://academy.datawithbaraa.com/l/d...\nTableau https://www.datawithbaraa.com/course/...\n\n🎓UDEMY\nSQL https://www.udemy.com/course/the-comp...\nPython https://www.udemy.com/course/the-comp...\nTableau https://www.udemy.com/course/the-tabl...\n\n━━━━━\n\nCONNECT WITH ME\n📬 Newsletter https://www.blog.datawithbaraa.com\n👨‍💻 LinkedIn   / baraa-khatib-salkini  \n📸 Instagram   / datawithbaraa  \n🎥 TikTok   / datawithbaraa  \n🌍 Website https://datawithbaraa.com/\n💬 Discord   / discord  \n🧭 Notion Roadmaps https://www.notion.com/@datawithbaraa\n⭐ Favorite Books/Gear https://candle-gosling-511.notion.sit...\n📩 Sponsorships baraa@datawithbaraa.com\n\n━━━━━\nGet 25% OFF DataCamp's Here  https://datacamp.pxf.io/bOEe66\n━━━━━\n\nMY FREE COURSES\nSQL    • SQL Full Course for Beginners (30 Hours) –...  \nPython    • Python Full Course for Beginners (13 Hours...  \nTableau    • Complete HR Tableau Project End-to-End | L...  \nDatabricks    • Databricks 2 Days Bootcamp  \nPower BI    • Power BI Ultimate Course  \nData Projects    • Data Analyst Portfolio Projects  \nData Careers    • Data Career Roadmaps  \n\n━━━━━\n\n📖 Table of Content\n__🟢Beginner Level__\n00:00 Intro\n07:38 Introduction to SQL  \n22:33 Setup Your Environment  \n34:01 Query Data (SELECT)  \n01:32:31 DDL Commands  \n01:43:44 DML Commands  \n\n__🟡Intermediate Level__\n02:08:03 Filtering Data  \n02:47:57 SQL Joins (Basics)\n03:27:29 SQL Joins (Advanced)\n04:02:09 Set Operators  \n04:47:41 SQL Functions  \n04:52:58 String Functions  \n05:18:44 Numeric Functions  \n05:22:48 Date and Time Functions  \n06:59:06 NULL Functions\n08:07:50 Case Statement\n08:43:36 Aggregate Functions  \n08:50:11 Window Fun